Usage:
  ccexplorer [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  get         Cost and usage summary for AWS services
  help        Help about any command
  mcp         Model Context Protocol server for ccExplorer

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for ccexplorer
  -v, --version   version for ccexplorer

Use "ccexplorer [command] --help" for more information about a command.
